  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>And relation is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mfenced close=\"\"><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mfenced open=\"\"><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8804;</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mtext>&#160;and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8804;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now taking cases for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8804;</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>cases</mtext></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>cases</mtext></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>cases</mtext></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>cases</mtext></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mn>10</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>cases</mtext></math></p><p>So, total&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn></math>&nbsp;cases will be there&nbsp;</p><p>Now finding cases of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8804;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>cases</mtext></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>cases</mtext></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>cases</mtext></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mn>9</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>cases</mtext></math></p><p>So, here total&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn></math>&nbsp;cases,</p><p>Hence, total elements in relation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>160</mn></math></p>",
